{"4531610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Goodbye Page", "steam_appid": 4531610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4531610/extras/69eb66236e5caa473f2ccd5673bd4f2e.avif?t=1785151810\" width=780 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After hearing a report that her long absent father has gone missing, Page decides to visit his house to see what, if anything, is left. However, something about the environment feels off. <i>“White,” the risk of being pure, intruding “Blue.” So I must ask Miss Page,</i> <i><strong>“How do you feel?”</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wait... Where?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goodbye Page</strong> is a third-person walking simulator where you play as Page, exploring the mysterious environment of her dad's house. With surreal settings and strange oddities throughout, can she uncover what is really happening in the house?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4531610/extras/27a3b8730cb5c4fc54866639ce3b1f48.poster.avif?t=1785151810\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4531610/extras/27a3b8730cb5c4fc54866639ce3b1f48.webm?t=1785151810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4531610/extras/27a3b8730cb5c4fc54866639ce3b1f48.mp4?t=1785151810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goodbye page may contain:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonsensical rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talking shapes?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal creatures<